OL,3,GNEWSAUK to draft in military aircraft
OL,4,Ato fight wildfires, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilitary planes and helicopters will be
OL,7,Fdrafted in to tackle wildfires, Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham is to tell the
OL,9,FUK's first summit on the issue.
OL,11,FCivilian fire services in all four
OL,12,Fnations will be able to request the
OL,13,Fsupport of the Royal Air Force's
OL,14,FChinook helicopters and A400M planes to
OL,15,Ffight wildfires on tough terrain such
OL,16,Fas remote moorland and steep hillsides.
OL,18,FBurnham said the measures were needed
OL,19,Fbecause "we cannot put people through
OL,20,Fanother summer like this one".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
