OL,3,GNEWSAUK to draft in military aircraft
OL,4,Ato fight wildfires, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government will host its first
OL,7,F"wildfire resilience summit" on Friday
OL,8,Fto discuss how to prevent, respond to
OL,9,Fand recover from such blazes after a
OL,10,Frecord-breaking summer 2026.
